  "factor_name": "Downside-volatility normalized residual reversal 20d",
  "version": "2031-11-27",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "rolling_mean_3((- (return_10d - cross_sectional_median(return_10d))) / clip(asset_downside_risk_20d / cross_sectional_median(asset_downside_risk_20d), 0.5, 2.5)).shift(1)",
    "description": "Ranks instruments for reversal of their 10-session return residual versus the cross-sectional median, dividing by relative 20-session downside volatility so unstable assets receive lower signal magnitude. A three-session mean and one-session lag prevent use of incomplete or future observations."
